[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9481.99, "timestamp": "02:38:01", "text": "这是附魔台。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9486.15, "timestamp": "02:38:06", "text": "就像我穿了一身附魔盔甲一样。我使用"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9491.72, "timestamp": "02:38:11", "text": "来这里就是为了做点事，伙计。上。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9494.389, "timestamp": "02:38:14", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9505.11, "timestamp": "02:38:25", "text": "等等，哦，对了。蓝色的那个。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9508.469, "timestamp": "02:38:28", "text": "记住这一点。是的。是的。而且在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9512.15, "timestamp": "02:38:32", "text": "我们以前经常在那里睡觉什么的，还有你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9514.23, "timestamp": "02:38:34", "text": "以前会给我提供狩猎装备。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9516.95, "timestamp": "02:38:36", "text": "天气不好，而且你还遇到了很多苦涩的事情。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9519.83, "timestamp": "02:38:39", "text": "头骨之类的东西。这里是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9521.91, "timestamp": "02:38:41", "text": "我花了很多时间在你那里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9525.03, "timestamp": "02:38:45", "text": "游戏。是的。是的。是的。沙壳"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9528.87, "timestamp": "02:38:48", "text": "还有一些其他的东西。我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9532.87, "timestamp": "02:38:52", "text": "你有很多沙壳。我当时就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9534.389, "timestamp": "02:38:54", "text": "如何"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9536.87, "timestamp": "02:38:56", "text": "然后我们就打败了那条龙之类的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9538.469, "timestamp": "02:38:58", "text": "是的。"}]